Done. Committed as `5fe7158`.

## Previous-step check (first, as asked)
`docs/STATUS.md` read, `typecheck` ✓, `lint` ✓, production `https://beautybymasha-mu.vercel.app` → HTTP 200. Step 03 left nothing broken, so I went straight to the task.

## What's on the page
Landing in BRAND.md §7 order: Nav · Hero · Loyalty · Usluge · Zakazivanje · Radovi · ORLY · Cenovnik · Lokacije · Recenzije · Kontakt.

**Hero** — R3F plane + fragment shader: simplex fBm, two-pass domain warping, the design-DNA palette, a slow specular band, ~24 s cycle. Pointer pushes the field with inertia, scroll pushes depth. `dpr [1,1.75]`, `antialias false`, `frameloop` drops to `demand` off-screen and on a hidden tab.

**Fallback** — `useHeroWebGL` requires WebGL2 **and** width > 768px **and** no `prefers-reduced-motion`. Fail any one and `<LiquidCanvas>` is never mounted; a static CSS radial-gradient renders instead. Verified at 390px: `#hero canvas` is absent. I made the fallback fully static rather than animating `background-position` — repainting the whole first screen every frame is exactly the cost her phone-first audience shouldn't pay.

**Scroll scenario** (desktop, no-preference only) — measured in the browser: hero pins (`position: fixed`), wordmark Flips into the nav (scale 1 → 0.067), the nav logo appears only on landing, the shader collapses 140% → 13% circle, pin releases.

**Wizard** — driven end to end against the live dev Convex deployment: location → search "secer" (finds "šećernom") → 45 real slots → submit → "Zahtev je primljen. Javljamo se u roku od 24 h". Test booking purged afterwards.

**Gallery** — `photo` variant, with `bbm-09`, `bbm-10`, `bbm-24` as `card` per their `note`. Alt texts verbatim.

## Final checks
`convex dev --once` ✓ · `typecheck` ✓ · `lint` ✓ (0 warnings) · `test` ✓ 79/79 · `build` ✓. Dev server stopped. The MOTION.md reveal check returns **`[]`** at 1440px and 390px, `pending` 0, `.reveal-word` 0, horizontal overflow 0.

## Three things I fixed that weren't mine, and two you should decide
Shared-file changes (all in STATUS.md): `Reveal` needed a `revealOff` escape hatch — an `<li>` holding only an image was hidden by `hideCss()`, skipped by `TextRevealGlobal` (no text), and `variant="clip"` never touches `opacity`, so it stayed invisible. `TextRevealGlobal` now also flushes elements that scrolled past unfired; fast scrolling reproducibly stranded 12 elements at 390px. Two latent type errors in `Card.tsx`/`Input.tsx` surfaced once the tsbuildinfo cache was invalidated.

Two calls I want to flag:

- **Diacritics are missing site-wide, and it's the data, not the code.** `data/site.json` and `data/services.json` are ASCII, so the page shows "Ljubicica" and "Depilacija secernom pastom". This is the most visible flaw on tomorrow's screen. I did not rewrite them: your memory notes those files are edited by a parallel session, and 144 of those strings are her verbatim price list. It's a one-pass data fix once you say go.
- **BRAND.md's fifth circle "Nega lica" has no services behind it.** The price list contains none. I used the `ostalo` group (brow lamination, kana, šminkanje, detox — all price-less) rather than invent a category. Also, she has no depilation or massage photos, so those two circles carry a pedicure and a nail-art shot; alt text is accurate, the motif isn't.

I created two ~30-line placeholder pages at `/shop` and `/nalog` so the "Ceo katalog" and "Registrujte se" buttons don't 404 during the demo. Both are marked in their file header as step-05's to delete.


